          <td><code>project</code></td>
          <td><code>mcpd.project</code> no span, depois no recurso, depois o <code>--project</code> do daemon</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><code>environment</code></td>
          <td><code>mcpd.environment</code>, <code>deployment.environment.name</code> do recurso, <code>deployment.environment</code> do recurso</td>
        </tr>
